Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.04,0:03:51.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur3\pos(1226,637)}你幸福嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.06,0:23:41.07,Next,,150,0,0,,{\blur3\fscx120\fscy120}歌仙式待人之道
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.07,0:02:15.45,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}愛してるって何だろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.37,0:02:20.70,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}辞書を引いてもピンと来なくて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.70,0:02:25.62,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}そうね　愛って何だろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.62,0:02:30.59,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}語り尽くせぬこの痛みが愛なんかも
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:37.39,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}始まりの対に終わりを創る
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.39,0:02:41.97,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}神様はとても残酷だよね
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.43,0:02:47.44,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}人間はきっと勇敢なんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.43,0:02:47.44,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fscx60\fscy60\pos(501,666)}ぼくら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.86,0:02:51.94,OP-JP,,0,500,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}終わりを知れどまだ前へ進むから
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.82,0:02:57.24,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}何を引き換えにしようとも
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.91,0:03:02.29,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}何度だって汚すよこの手なら
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:07.04,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}後悔に似た罪の意識
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:12.00,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}隠して歩む道は何処へと続くの
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.30,0:03:20.51,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}いつか君が死んじゃうって想像するだけで痛いんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.85,0:03:23.18,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}心臓を握りつぶすのは誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.85,0:03:23.18,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2\fscx60\fscy60\pos(482,666)}こころ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:25.64,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}キミが愛なんだろうね
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.64,0:03:30.31,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}いつか二人を引き離す終わりが迎えに来ようとも
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.31,0:03:35.57,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}誰も追いつけやしないスピードで
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:39.74,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}どこまでも逃げてみせるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.07,0:02:15.45,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}「我愛你」是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.37,0:02:20.70,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}查了辭典也毫無頭緒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.70,0:02:25.62,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}對啊 愛究竟是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.62,0:02:30.59,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}這道不盡的痛 或許就是愛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:37.39,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}萬物有始必有終
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.39,0:02:41.97,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}神明就是這麼殘酷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.43,0:02:47.44,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}人類一定都是勇敢的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.86,0:02:51.94,OP-CH,,0,500,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}雖知有終 卻從未停下前進的腳步
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.82,0:02:57.24,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}無論代價為何
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.91,0:03:02.29,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}無論要髒了這雙手多少次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:07.04,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}罪惡感亦如悔意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:12.00,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}將其隱蔽 帶著它走下去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.30,0:03:20.51,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}一想到你終將離世 我便痛入心脾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.85,0:03:23.18,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}究竟是誰握碎了我的心臟？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:25.64,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}是因為你即我的摯愛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.64,0:03:30.31,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}即使總有一天 終結會將你我分離
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.31,0:03:35.57,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}我也會用無人能及的速度
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:39.74,OP-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur2}逃往天涯海角
Comment: 0,0:22:05.97,0:22:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.34,0:22:11.16,ED-EN,,0,0,0,,I decided to be stronger than anyone around
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.16,0:22:14.39,ED-EN,,0,0,0,,Goodbye old self goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.99,0:22:26.55,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,Now it’s time for me to take a breath
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.56,0:22:31.34,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,You know I don’t want to lose anything
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.01,0:22:35.52,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,Don’t wanna see the end I need this more
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.53,0:22:40.06,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,I want to feel the warmth I can’t let go
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.06,0:22:44.59,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,Not gonna give it up because I know my strength
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.59,0:22:49.46,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,I’m barely breathing but I’m keepin’ up to live my life
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.93,0:22:55.91,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,I decided to be stronger than anyone around
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.91,0:22:59.78,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,I hide my trembling hand and just keep pushin’ on
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.78,0:23:04.70,ED-EN,,0,300,0,,Cause the things I need to guard gives me the power to conquer carry on
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.70,0:23:06.82,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,Goodbye old self
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.82,0:23:11.11,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,Never going back to the me I fought to leave behind
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.11,0:23:14.79,ED-EN,,0,500,0,,Hello new me, this time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.41,0:23:15.79,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(0,720)\fs30\k10\2a&HFF&\c&HFFFFFF&}保{\k10}護{\k10}家{\k10}人{\k10} {\k10}便{\k10}是{\k10}我{\k10}現{\k10}在{\k10}的{\k10}一{\k10}切
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
